Description: Edukasaun Desktop 0.9.15 - Action Center, Edukasaun-Dark and Login Screen
 Edukasaun Desktop, Eduka-Menu, Eduka-Menu Settings, and Eduka-Panel.
 One sound control and working brightness in the Action Center, a modern
 calendar, visible spin box arrows, random hover colors in Eduka-Desktop,
 the Edukasaun-Dark theme (Orchis dark colors), free icon theme choice, an
 Edukasaun SDDM login theme, live session autologin and the standard
 edukasaun account for new images.
